WEBVTT

00:04.784 --> 00:05.840
<v Ivonn> Do you have any references?

00:05.840 --> 00:07.240
Certificate of aptitude...

00:07.240 --> 00:08.900
Professional experience with a BTS...

00:08.900 --> 00:10.660
Work-study program at the Bayer Institute...

00:10.660 --> 00:12.000
<v Driss> Two hours I'm waiting, go ahead, no, no!

00:22.760 --> 00:27.460
According to the contract, you also have an outbuilding.

00:30.000 --> 00:31.760
<v Driss> Get up, Philippe!

00:31.760 --> 00:32.800
Who is this guy?

00:32.800 --> 00:34.060
Everyone around you is worried.

00:34.420 --> 00:38.380
<v Phillipe> He is tall, he is strong, he has two arms, two legs, a functioning brain, he is healthy.

00:38.680 --> 00:39.580
<v Driss> It's too long right now!

00:39.580 --> 00:41.040
The guys from the cities, they have no mercy.

00:41.360 --> 00:41.900
<v Phillipe> That's what I want.

00:42.960 --> 00:43.540
<v Phillipe> No mercy.

00:44.360 --> 00:44.560
<v Driss> There you go.

00:44.760 --> 00:45.580
<v Driss> Is it good like that?

00:45.580 --> 00:45.840
Wait a minute.

00:48.340 --> 00:49.720
<v Driss> It's a phew thing there.

00:51.060 --> 00:52.640
<v Phillipe> You're done playing, aren't you?

00:52.640 --> 00:54.040
<v Driss> But in fact you feel nothing at all there.

00:54.420 --> 00:55.040
<v Ivonn> Enjoy your meal.

00:56.540 --> 01:00.000
<v Phillipe> Hey, hey, hey, hey.

01:00.000 --> 01:02.840
<v Driss> It borders on laziness there, we have to send back a little.

01:08.100 --> 01:09.500
<v Phillipe> Don't you want to set sail?

01:09.500 --> 01:10.720
<v Driss> You want to get out of here, right?

01:14.720 --> 01:16.860
<v Driss> And where are we going?

01:16.860 --> 01:17.580
<v Phillipe> Breathe a little.

01:27.580 --> 01:30.660
<v Driss> What is this goal game?

01:30.660 --> 01:33.039
<v Driss> Hey, my gout, it's fucking!

01:36.000 --> 01:37.220
<v Driss> Open your eyes.

01:38.060 --> 01:38.720
<v Phillipe> What a horror.

01:41.039 --> 01:41.440
<v Phillipe> No.

01:42.340 --> 01:42.580
<v Driss> Nein.

01:42.680 --> 01:44.580
<v Driss> I will...

01:49.580 --> 01:51.680
<v Driss> Do we agree that here I am your arms and legs?